sVTED may use the information to understand its members and to provide information about membership benefits.
p11
I1
sVWe may collect non-personal information about the computer, mobile device or other device you use to access TED Sites, such as IP address, geolocation information, unique device identifiers, browser type, browser language and other preferences automatically collected.
p12
I1
sVWe use data we collect to send email newsletters, or information about conferences and TED events (if you have opted in for this information) as well as enabling TED to invite users to provide feedback on their user experience on TED offerings.
